@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #455A70
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle uml2
title MVVM — клиент электронных медицинских карт
rectangle "View\nPatientWindow / WPF" as view
rectangle "ViewModel\nPatientViewModel" as vm
interface "IMedicalApiClient\nAIS.Core" as port
rectangle "Model\nPatientSummary / AccessRequest" as model
rectangle "MedicalApiClient\nAIS.Infrastructure" as client
rectangle "API Gateway" as api
view --> vm : Binding / LoadCommand
vm --> view : PropertyChanged
vm --> port : async / await
vm --> model : состояние данных
client ..|> port
client --> api : HTTPS / JSON
note bottom of vm
Нет SQL, HttpClient или кода WPF.
Ошибка очищает прежние данные.
end note

@enduml
